OL,3,ALearner drivers still waiting 20 weeks
OL,4,Ato book tests
OL,5,
OL,6,FLearner drivers have to wait an average
OL,7,F20 weeks before booking a practical
OL,8,Ftest, according to new figures, despite
OL,9,Fattempts to reduce delays.
OL,11,FThe data from the Driver and Vehicle
OL,12,FStandards Agency (DVSA) for August is
OL,13,Fonly a marginal improvement from an
OL,14,F20.2 weeks in July.
OL,16,FThe average wait time between booking
OL,17,Fand sitting a test is unchanged at 11.1
OL,18,Fweeks.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
